      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王她那\n总是自信坦荡的模样，\n在比赛时也是一项优势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2de33e1851d525a7ff5a1b4b490ee85e25a00cc131aebccb978e3275573e6c00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
