      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当我告诉她只要能不被周遭情况影响，\n并按照自己的步调奔跑的话，\n就能发挥100％的实力后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c8f151d52bc0b65fb8fdcbce44d9d22da30c72ab255d4902ac92a16e3ffe3f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
